# NOTE: COOP / COEP headers are intentionally NOT set here.
#
# `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp` enables SharedArrayBuffer
# (multithreaded ffmpeg) but blocks Google AdSense scripts, ad iframes and
# creatives, because Google does not send the required CORP header.
#
# With these headers absent, AdSense loads normally and the app falls back to
# the single-threaded ffmpeg core automatically. Add the two headers back only
# if you decide to disable ads and want faster multithreaded processing.
#
# Optional performance headers that are safe with ads:
# /*
#   Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
